<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH CUP FINAL TO BE DECIDED ON PENALTIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH CUP FINAL TO BE DECIDED ON PENALTIES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Cup final between Guingamp and Nice was being settled by a penalty shootout after the teams were level at 1-1 after extra time on Saturday.</p>
</text>
